						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Hi guys,<br />
     I am starting to get ready to do the third Quest for my epic and I was thinking of all the memebers that are in there 40's and I can seem to think of that many.  I f you guys can send a reply to this if you guys are in the 40's or will get there soon.  There are 2 reasons why I am curious.  1st being all class quest armor.  The armor that I am going for is Thurgadin, 1 of the easier to get and has better stats than most.  To do this I need to kill giants in GD to get faction with the coldain dwarfs.  Ths is something we all can do if we all chose to do the same quest armor.  The giants are lvl 40-45 and are easy to kill with a group.  Doing this will get us the faction we need (ally) with the coldain and get some XP while doing it.<br />
     The next thing we need to do is go to cobalt scar and farm for the gems we need to combine with the drops we need from the planes to make the armor.  It is a long process and hard to even attempt if you are not at least 50 but it is good to start thinking about this stuff early on.  So for all of us above 40 or will be there shortly pls pick a Quest armor that you want so we can start working on our faction to get the particular armor you chose asap.  You can view the differnt armors and get the info needed on them at Allakhazam.com<br />
<br />
Agrivar Noble paladin Advisor						</td>
